Steelray
========

steelray is a very simplistic hobbyist kernel written in rust.


Compilation
-----------

Requires:

- aarch64-linux-gnu-gcc
- aarch64-linux-gnu-binutils
- aarch64-unknown-none rust toolchain

    make

Running
-------

Requires qemu-system-aarch64

    make run

(Exit with Ctrl+A x)

Attaching
---------

    gdb
    > target remote :1234
